{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1429757-christmas-angels","id":1429757,"title":"Christmas Angels","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-12-24T10:30:33-08:00","id":1429757,"title":"Christmas Angels","content":"Since we've got the holiday season going on right now, I've written up a low-rank angel base on one of my (least) favourite Christmas traditions. If you have any angels based on the winter holidays of a denomination, please feel free to add them to the thread too!<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">Watchful Elves</span><br /> The God Machine may be an ineffable entity beyond mortal comprehension, but sometimes the Unchained are convinced it has a twisted sense of humour. Or at least a well-honed taste for irony. With each passing year, more Watchful Elves appear in cities around the world. Hiding in Twilight, they appear as thin, wooden dolls with mocking grins, dressed up as Father Christmas. Apart from the digital wings and holographic halos marking them as angels, they wouldn\u2019t look out of place in a household preparing for the Yule season. They are especially prevalent during the Christmas season, but the God Machine deploys swarms of them year-round. The elves aren\u2019t a physical threat to Demons in any way, but they aren\u2019t supposed to be either. They Fetter themselves to anyone who interacts with crowds, people the general public overlook, but who see everything. Cab drivers, parking officers, and mall security are all favourite hosts. From there, they both gather gossip to forward to Stigmatic cults and other angels, while keeping an eye out for Demons who slip up.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">Watchful Elf</span><br /> <b>Virtue: </b>Prying<br /> <b>Vice:</b> Mischievous <br /> <b>Rank:</b> 1<br /> <b>Attributes:</b> Power 1, Finesse 5, Resistance 2<br /> <b>Influence:</b> Eavesdropping 2<br /> <b>Corpus:</b> 4<br /> <b>Willpower:</b> 7<br /> <b>Size:</b> 2<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 11 (species factor 5) <br /> <b>Defense: </b>5<br /> <b>Initiative:</b> +7 <br /> <b>Armor:</b> 0<br /> <b>Numina: </b>Sign<br /> <b>Manifestation:</b> Fetter, Twilight Form, Unfetter<br /> <b>Max Essence:</b> 10<br /> <b>Ban: </b>Must move to a new workplace every day<br /> <b>Bane:</b> Coal in a stocking","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-24T11:00:48-08:00","id":1429760,"title":"","content":"I love it. This is really cool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-24T17:46:34-08:00","id":1429801,"title":"","content":"Influence is higher than Rank, which is supposed to be a no-no.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-24T17:49:10-08:00","id":1429802,"title":"","content":"And for an added twist, any children they feel will not grow up to become good little cogs in the Machine are pointed out to the true fae known variously as Krampus, Grandfather Winter, Saint Nick, or the Wendigo. He is part of the system, and loves snatching up naughty children into his sack to turn into elfin toymaker's, leaving only a fetch made of coal behind. These fetches almost invariably are &quot;nice&quot;, and serve the God Machine's agenda of obedience and selflessness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-24T18:44:25-08:00","id":1429814,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1429757-christmas-angels?p=1429801#post1429801\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Influence is higher than Rank, which is supposed to be a no-no.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, someone pointed that out on Discord too. It's only Influence 2 as opposed to 1, so I'm not too fussed about it, but you could swap one dot over to secrets, judgement, or surveillance if you wanted to do it by the books. Or make up a Numen that lets Influence exceed rank,possibly costing more Essence as a tradeoff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-25T16:27:33-08:00","id":1429909,"title":"","content":"As it\u2019s an Angel, it could use an Incept as well. I\u2019d suggest either Units, Space, or Time. To help it eavesdrop I\u2019d suggest Space so it can use its Influence more easily, though Units would be super useful for Sign or it\u2019s Influence regarding multiple people to spy on. Plus it has that elfy feel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 12-25-2020, 07:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-09T17:23:41-08:00","id":1431636,"title":"","content":"Looking at this, I can't help but wonder just what sort of Angels we could make for the various other holidays, such as Valentine's Day and Halloween/All Hallows Eve. They would most certainly be interesting to at least read...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target